---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Brift"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the implementation and use of Brift construction operations software."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Legal Review Notice Alert -->
      <div class="mb-8 rounded-xl border border-yellow/60 bg-yellow/15 p-4 text-sm text-ink-2">
        <strong class="font-bold text-ink">Legal Notice:</strong> These terms of service are an initial informational draft prepared for platform development. They must be formally reviewed and finalized by qualified legal counsel prior to live commercial agreements.
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-card-lg border border-line bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">Terms of Service</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-2">Last updated: September 2026</p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing or using the Brift marketing website and tailored construction software platforms, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">2. Services & Deployment Model</h2>
          <p>
            Brift provides customized construction enterprise software deployments. Each client's environment is provisioned with tailored site configurations, user roles, and reporting modules as specified in the agreed proposal schedule.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">3. Setup Fees & Monthly Maintenance</h2>
          <p>
            All plans include a one-time setup fee covering bespoke workflow configuration and the first 12 months of cloud hosting, backups, and maintenance. Commencing in month 13, clients pay the designated monthly maintenance fee matching their tier (Core: ₹300/mo, Growth: ₹300/mo, Partner: ₹800/mo).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">4. Client Responsibilities</h2>
          <p>
            Clients are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their administrative credentials and verifying project purchases, client receipts, and contractor payouts before approving transactions into financial records.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink">5. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For inquiries regarding service agreements or terms:
            <br />
            <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:brift.official@gmail.com" class="text-blue hover:underline">brift.official@gmail.com</a>
            <br />
            <strong>Phone:</strong> +91 9037532036
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
